error BYN1032: `if !x {…}` with no `else` is an input form; write `unless x {…}`

  3 │     if !done {
    │     ^^^^^^^^ a negated condition with no `else`
    │
  help: write `unless` with the condition as written
    │ 3 │     unless done {
    │   │     +++++++

error BYN1032: `if !x {…}` with no `else` is an input form; write `unless x {…}`

  6 │     if !(args.length == 2) {
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a negated condition with no `else`
    │
  help: write `unless` with the condition as written
    │ 6 │     unless args.length == 2 {
    │   │     +++++++++++++++++++++++
